--[[ Information
	


	Return to the English client text:
		/script SetCVar("language.2", "en")

	ZOS numerical constants for alliance returned from:  GetUnitAlliance("player")
		For appending different text based on player alliance
			ALLIANCE_ALDMERI_DOMINION
			ALLIANCE_DAGGERFALL_COVENANT
			ALLIANCE_EBONHEART_PACT
	
	Repeated objective:
		Add number to end  (e.q. ["Objective 1"], ["Objective 2"], etc.)
		Each needs a stepTextKey field to assign appendText
		
	Numbered quest objectives are changes to the second paragraph in the quest journal
	
	On quests with numbered objectives (0/3, 0/x, etc.), add a space before any line breaks, or it will not save correctly
	
--]]




