				{appendText=" in the crypts near a warded coffin.\n\nA portal to the crypts is within a smaller crypt off the center of Cath Bedraud."},
			["Find the Lost Knights"] =
				{appendText=" further within the labyrinth. \nSir Lanis Shaldon is a veteran and likely has a plan.\n\nA portal to the crypts is within a smaller crypt off the center of Cath Bedraud."},
